    "title": "Kansas State Board of Agriculture to Hold Quarterly Meeting on March 6",
    "text": "Mike Beam Secretary of Agriculture | Kansas Department Of Agriculture\nMike Beam Secretary of Agriculture | Kansas Department Of Agriculture\nThe Kansas State Board of Agriculture will convene for its regular quarterly meeting on Thursday, March 6, at 1:00 p.m. The meeting will take place at the Kansas Department of Agriculture office, located at 1320 Research Park Dr. in Manhattan, Kansas.\nThis session is open to the public and will be held in person only. Attendees interested in obtaining a copy of the agenda or additional details may contact Auburn Wassberg at\nAuburn.Wassberg@ks.gov.\nIndividuals requiring special accommodations must submit their requests at least 24 hours in advance of the meeting.\nInformation from this article can be found\nhere.\nORGANIZATIONS IN THIS STORY\n!RECEIVE ALERTS\nSign-up\nDONATE\nDonate",
